    "This tip is completely voluntary and only supports the developer. It will not unlock anything, and not giving a tip will not restrict your use of HistoryLib. Apple processes the payment and decides refunds. HistoryLib cannot directly issue or guarantee a refund. Have you read, understood, and agreed to this information and still want to give a tip?" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "هذه الإكرامية اختيارية وتدعم المطوّر فقط. لا تفتح شيئًا ولا تقيّد عدمُ تقديمها استخدامك. تعالج Apple الدفع وتقرر الاسترداد. لا تستطيع HistoryLib ضمانه. هل قرأت وفهمت ووافقت وما زلت تريد تقديمها؟"
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This tip is completely voluntary and only supports the developer. It will not unlock anything, and not giving a tip will not restrict your use of HistoryLib. Apple processes the payment and decides refunds. HistoryLib cannot directly issue or guarantee a refund. Have you read, understood, and agreed to this information and still want to give a tip?"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta propina es voluntaria y no desbloquea nada. Apple procesa el pago y decide los reembolsos. HistoryLib no puede garantizarlos. ¿Has entendido y quieres continuar?"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce pourboire est facultatif et soutient uniquement le développeur. Il ne débloque rien. Apple traite le paiement et décide des remboursements. HistoryLib ne peut pas les garantir. Avez-vous compris et souhaitez-vous continuer ?"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Эти чаевые добровольны и ничего не открывают. Apple обрабатывает платёж и решает вопросы возврата. HistoryLib не может гарантировать возврат. Вы всё поняли и хотите продолжить?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这笔小费完全自愿，只用于支持开发者。它不会解锁任何内容，不支付小费也不会限制你使用 HistoryLib。付款由 Apple 处理，退款由 Apple 决定。HistoryLib 无法直接发放或保证退款。你是否已经阅读、理解并同意以上内容，并仍然确认给小费？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
